  "partition:keys": [
    {
      "name": "year",
      "type": "int32",
      "description": "Year of acquisition (UTC). Years before 2019 are one items.parquet each. From 2019 each year is split by the UTM zone of s2:mgrs_tile (the leading one or two digits of the tile id): 2019\u20132020 into 4 files, z01-20.parquet (zones 1\u201320), z21-35.parquet (zones 21\u201335), z36-46.parquet (zones 36\u201346), z47-60.parquet (zones 47\u201360); from 2021 into 8 files, z01-15.parquet (zones 1\u201315), z16-20.parquet (zones 16\u201320), z21-31.parquet (zones 21\u201331), z32-35.parquet (zones 32\u201335), z36-40.parquet (zones 36\u201340), z41-46.parquet (zones 41\u201346), z47-52.parquet (zones 47\u201352), z53-60.parquet (zones 53\u201360). The current year adds live.parquet, the tail fetched daily since the last consolidation. There is no zone= directory: every part sits in year=YYYY/ and matches partition:glob, and a reader with a tile id opens only the part whose zone range holds it."
    }
  ],
